# Front-end build-time config (Vite). Only VITE_* vars are exposed to the
# browser bundle. Copy to `.env` for local builds if needed.

# Absolute URL of the serverless Spotify token endpoint. Leave unset to use
# the same-origin default "/api/spotify-token" (correct on a Vercel deploy).
# Set this only if the static site is hosted on a different origin than the
# function, e.g. GitHub Pages calling a Vercel function:
# VITE_SPOTIFY_TOKEN_ENDPOINT=https://your-app.vercel.app/api/spotify-token

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SERVER-SIDE secrets for api/spotify-token.ts. DO NOT put these in a VITE_
# variable and DO NOT commit real values. Set them in the Vercel dashboard
# (Project → Settings → Environment Variables), or in a local `.env` for
# `vercel dev`:
#   SPOTIFY_CLIENT_ID=your_client_id
#   SPOTIFY_CLIENT_SECRET=your_client_secret
#   ALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://your-app.vercel.app,https://you.github.io
